.TH BOOTSTRAP-MU2E-RUNDB-VIEWER 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-runlog-db t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
bootstrap-mu2e-rundb-viewer \- create or update the viewer virtualenv
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bootstrap\-mu2e\-rundb\-viewer
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates
.I .venv/
next to the script with
.B python3 \-m venv
if
.I .venv/bin/python
is not executable, then runs
.B pip install \-\-upgrade pip
and
.BR "pip install \-r requirements.txt \-\-upgrade" .
Every run contacts PyPI and may move installed packages to newer versions
within the ranges in
.IR requirements.txt .
It is called on every start by
.BR start\-mu2e\-rundb\-viewer (1).
.PP
.I requirements.txt
pins Django 4.2.x, django-allauth 0.61.x, PyYAML, python-dotenv,
psycopg2-binary and gunicorn.
The optional
.B mu2edaq\-discovery
package is deliberately not listed (it is not on PyPI); install it from the
sibling checkout with
.B pip install ../mu2edaq\-discovery
to enable service announcement.
.SH OPTIONS
None.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I .venv/
.TP
.I requirements.txt
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; the exit status of the failing
.B python3
or
.B pip
command otherwise (the script runs under
.BR "set \-euo pipefail" ).
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
\&./bootstrap\-mu2e\-rundb\-viewer
\&.venv/bin/pip install ../mu2edaq\-discovery
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR start\-mu2e\-rundb\-viewer (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group, Fermilab.
